    "Let us create a personalized itinerary just for you. Fill out the form below and our safari experts will get back to you within 24 hours.": "带您去往文章中提到的目的地，带来定制之旅体验。",
    "Tanzania's Wonders": "坦桑尼亚奇观",
    "From the vast plains of the Serengeti and the iconic Ngorongoro Crater to the majestic peaks of Mount Kilimanjaro and Zanzibar's pristine white-sand beaches. Your adventure of a lifetime is just one click away.": "从塞伦盖蒂的辽阔大沙原和内格罗河峡谷到乞力马扎罗雄伟山峰，以及赞比亚金沙滩，您一生的探险离您仅一点击之遥。",
    "Complete the details below to secure your Tanzanian adventure.": "请填写以下详细信息，预订您的坦桑尼亚之旅。",
    "Select Your Country": "选择您的国家",
