    "Over the years, we have helped travelers explore Tanzania's most iconic destinations while connecting them with local communities, wildlife, and natural wonders. Whether it's witnessing the Great Migration, climbing Africa's highest mountain, or enjoying a relaxing beach holiday, we design each adventure with attention to detail and a commitment to excellence.": "多年来我们与游客共同探索了坦桑尼亚标志性的景点，搭建本地社区、野生动物与自然奇观。",
    "Your safety and comfort are our non-negotiable priorities. From the moment you step off the plane until your final departure, our dedicated logistics team is available around the clock. We handle every complex detail, from flight transfers to medical contingencies, giving you the absolute peace of mind to fully immerse yourself in the majestic beauty of the African wilderness.": "您的安全与舒适是首要任务。从下飞机到离开，我们贴身服务，24小时跟随。从机场接待到医疗紧急预案，一切细节都交托给专业团队，带您尽情领略非洲荒野的雄伟美景。",
    "Ethics": "伦理",
    "Sustainable Travel": "可持续旅行",
    "We are deeply committed to preserving the wild spaces we call home. Our operations follow strict low-impact guidelines, supporting eco-friendly lodges and plastic-free initiatives. By choosing us, you become a partner in protecting Tanzania’s natural heritage for future generations, ensuring that the wild remains wild.": "我们致力于保护家园的野生环境。操作遵循低影响原则，支持生态度假村与零塑料举措。与我们共行，是各界伙伴的力量，守护坦桑尼亚自然遗产。",
    "Heritage": "传统",
    "Authentic Connections": "深度沟通",
    "Beyond the wildlife, we connect you with the vibrant soul of Tanzania. Through respectful and meaningful cultural exchanges with local tribes and communities, we offer a rare glimpse into the traditions and history of our land. Experience the true warmth of African hospitality that stays with you long after you return home.": "与野生动物之外的坦桑尼亚灵魂互联。通过尊重与当地部落及社区的深度交流，带您领略这片土地的传统与历史。感受持久驻足于非洲热情好客之风的延续。",
    "Thank you for your message! We have received your inquiry and will get back to you soon.": "感谢您的留言！我们已收到，将尽快回复您。",
    "Thank you! We'll send you a personalized itinerary within 24 hours.": "感谢！我们将在24小时内为您发送定制行程。",
    "Our guides are born and raised in the heart of the Tanzanian wilderness, possessing an instinctive understanding of wildlife behavior and migratory patterns. With over a decade of field experience, they offer deep insights into the delicate balance of our ecosystem, ensuring every sighting is not just seen, but understood and ethically managed.": "我们的导游素有深厚的本地知识。",
    "We believe no two travelers are the same, and neither should their journeys be. Our expert consultants work tirelessly with you to craft bespoke itineraries that match your specific pace, personal interests, and budget. From private photography expeditions to multi-generational family adventures, we personalize every detail to create your dream escape.": "每位游客都独一无二，行程也随之定制，深入倾听您的偏好与预算。从豪华徒步到超值之旅，每一次出行都是为您量身打造。",
    "By operating directly on the ground from our headquarters in Tanzania, we eliminate unnecessary third-party commissions and middleman fees. This allows us to offer ultra-premium experiences at exceptionally competitive rates while ensuring that a larger portion of your travel investment goes directly into local conservation efforts and community upliftment.": "我们的导游素有深厚的本地知识。",
