    "Every photo tells a story of adventure, breath-taking landscapes, and unforgettable encounters in the heart of Africa.": "每一张照片都讲述了一段冒险故事、惊艳山水与记忆深刻的非洲之旅。",
    "We are currently curating the most beautiful moments from recent safaris. Check back very soon.": "我们正在精选最近游艇里的精彩时刻，请稍后再来。",
